    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33290" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκ-χῠτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκχέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>poured forth, unconfined</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόμη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.669.8
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Marian.
			</span></i>); <i>outstretched</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκχυτος
				ὕπνῳ κεῖτο</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				5.274
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Paul.Sil.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>immoderate</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέλως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Suid.
				</span></i>
			
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καγχασμός</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκχυτον, τό</span>, dub. sens. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.395
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Pall.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτόν</span> tit., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶδος βρώματος</span> Sch.); title of
			dialogue on <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾠοσκοπία</span> by
			Hermagoras, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				1.102
			</span></i>.</div>
